* {{sense|become a member}} {{l|en|enlist}}, {{l|en|join}}, {{l|en|join up}}, {{l|en|sign up}}, {{l|en|subscribe}}
* {{sense|join a class}} {{l|en|add}}, {{l|en|register}} for {{qualifier|synonyms for “enroll in [a class]”}}

